  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A B grade talent is often a future clan elder and reaches rank three after six or seven years.",
      "chapters": [
        4
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_b_grade"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Only rank three Gu Masters produce white silver coloured primeval essence. One portion of white silver equals ten portions of red iron.",
      "chapters": [
        22
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In early Southern Border clan framing, rank three Gu Masters are family elders.",
      "chapters": [
        31
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Advancing to rank three is a qualitative change and a threshold: in the clan, any Gu Master who reaches it becomes an elder and joins the decision makers’ circle.",
      "chapters": [
        148
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the five mortal ranks, rank three sits in the middle and connects beginners to the high fighting force. By that point a Gu Master is full-fledged, and rank three is the most important stage for building foundations and choosing the right direction to advance.",
      "chapters": [
        275
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "direction-and-foundation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The mortal stretch through rank five is covered on Rank One through Rank Five. The wider ladder is covered on ranks and realms.",
